mcp-server-semaphore (0.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rename package semaphore-mcp-server → mcp-server-semaphore
    (Provides/Replaces/Breaks for clean apt upgrade).
  * Update companion Depends and Vcs URLs for the GitHub rename.
  * Add MCP tool annotations (readOnlyHint / destructiveHint) for all 37 tools.
  * Fix environment tools to use VariableGroupApi (ProjectApi had no env methods).
  * Fix schedule_list and key_get via raw ApiClient GET (missing in generated client).
  * Pass sort/order to environment_list as required by the Semaphore API.
  * Add tests/live_capability_scenario.py for live read + READ_ONLY write guards.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Mon, 21 Sep 2026 15:45:00 +0200

